                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-07-12"><hi rendition="#italic">July 12,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger reports that punishment edict has been issued and Ragsdale has been
                    paid the money for transmittal to family of Mr. Etzel.)</p>
            </div>
